// ============================================================================
//  Windows icon resource.
//
//  Why this file exists:
//    Without it the .exe has no icon resource at all, so Explorer / the
//    taskbar / Alt-Tab show the generic Windows application icon.
//    (The tray icon is drawn at runtime as a coloured dot and is unrelated.)
//
//  build-launcher.bat passes this file to g++/windres, which embeds
//  Traiectus.ico into the exe.  Keep this file ASCII-only: it is compiled on
//  Windows with the local OEM code page.
// ============================================================================

1 ICON "Traiectus.ico"
